// Title: MITRE BZAR Indicators for Persistence
// ID: 53389db6-ba46-48e3-a94c-e0f2cefe1583
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: @neu5ron, SOC Prime
// Date: 2020-03-19
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1547.004
// Description: Windows DCE-RPC functions which indicate a persistence techniques on the remote system. All credit for the Zeek mapping of the suspicious endpoint/operation field goes to MITRE.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((endpoint EQ "spoolss" AND operation EQ "RpcAddMonitor") OR (endpoint EQ "spoolss" AND operation EQ "RpcAddPrintProcessor") OR (endpoint EQ "IRemoteWinspool" AND operation EQ "RpcAsyncAddMonitor") OR (endpoint EQ "IRemoteWinspool" AND operation EQ "RpcAsyncAddPrintProcessor") OR (endpoint EQ "ISecLogon" AND operation EQ "SeclCreateProcessWithLogonW") OR (endpoint EQ "ISecLogon" AND operation EQ "SeclCreateProcessWithLogonExW"))
